# Hosts Beeper Server may reach, TCP 443 only. Deployed to
# /etc/beeper-egress/hosts; read by beeper-egress. Everything not listed is
# rejected and logged as "beeper-reject:" in the kernel journal.
api.beeper.com                      # Desktop API account calls, update feed; shares its address with ai-services.beeper.com
matrix.beeper.com                   # homeserver; CNAME to a pool of 6 v4 + 6 v6 addresses
roomserv.beeper.com                 # room service
sygnal.beeper.com                   # push gateway
updates.beeper.com                  # self-update
download.beeper.com                 # self-update
beeper-desktop.download.beeper.com  # the update feed's artifact URL host
